      "labHtml": "<ol><li><strong>Field Interview:</strong> Ask two people (one Christian, one not): <em>\"If you could describe God in three words, what would they be?\"</em> Record and analyze their answers. What do they reveal about popular Filipino views of God? How do they align with or diverge from Scripture?</li></ol>\n<ol><li><strong>Folk Religion Analysis:</strong> Identify one popular Filipino belief about God — from folk Catholicism, prosperity preaching, or folk spirituality — and contrast it with the doctrine of aseity. Write 150 words.</li></ol>\n<ol><li><strong>Personal Reflection:</strong> Write 200 words: <em>What does it mean for your daily life that God is completely self-sufficient and needs nothing from you?</em></li></ol>",
